carved lettering instead of plain text. Here is what changed. Combat comes alive Victory, Your Turn and End Turn are now carved stone plaques with hand made lettering. Damage discs show exactly how hard each attack will hit, on both your ca","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T18:14:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391778","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4860680-1843481262699089","game_id":"steam-4860680","kind":"announcement","title":"Run Overhaul: Card Drafting Arrives, and We're in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hey Dawnseekers, Back in July we tore out combat and rebuilt it as a card battle system. It fixed the fight. It did not fix the run. Here is what kept happening in testing. Fight one was tense. Fight two was tense. By fight five you were playing the same fight again, with the same deck, making the same reads. Every battle worked on its own. Stacked end to end, a climb started to blur. A roguelike run is supposed to go somewhere. Ours went in a straight line. So we added the thing that was missin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T09:30:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699089","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4860680-1840310314342334","game_id":"steam-4860680","kind":"announcement","title":"Outpost Overhaul: Buildings, Dawnseekers & Research Reforged","summary":"Hey Dawnseekers,Last week we showed you the combat overhaul. This week, the outpost got the same treatment.That's what the outpost looked like before. Flat panels, generic bars, interface elements that could belong to any game. It worked, but it didn't feel like the depths.So we rebuilt all of it.THE NEW OUTPOST— BUILDINGS: Every structure in your colony now sits in a hand-crafted interface of carved stone, rusted metal, and creeping fungal growth. Kitchen, Houses, Water Reclaimer, and the rest ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T16:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342334","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4860680-1839676055886149","game_id":"steam-4860680","kind":"announcement","title":"Combat Overhaul: Card Battles Have Arrived","summary":"Hey Dawnseekers,We need to be honest with you about something.While playtesting Zone 1, we kept running into the same problem: you fight a LOT on your way up. And our old combat system, simple attack and defend exchanges, just couldn't carry that weight. It worked. But it wasn't fun by the tenth fight. And a climb to the surface deserves better than \"it works.\"So we made a hard call. We threw the old combat out and rebuilt it from zero.COMBAT IS NOW A CARD BATTLE SYSTEMEvery fight is now a tacti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T18:38:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4860680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4860680":"2026-10-26T14:52:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4860680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:11Z"},"5265980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:12Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4860680","app_id":4860680,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"7f5f44159ea72e4675757eedaeefefe9c0609db576178474f1d3f01157eb132f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Colony management roguelite. After every combat, draft one of three cards to build your run. The surface world ended a thousand years ago. Now the road up is open. Build a colony, send your six survivors into the dark, and reach for the first dawn in a thousand years.","publishers":[{"name":"Max Karnaukh"}],"developers":[{"name":"Max Karnaukh"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793973600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Deep Rise Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1783949320","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4860680/1120744109/d7159c4a82a9b591134c60a0cb83b2261cb910d1/1783948962/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4860680/1120744109/d7159c4a82a9b591134c60a0cb83b2261cb910d1/1783948962/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"4860680/1120744109/d7159c4a82a9b591134c60a0cb83b2261cb910d1/1783948962/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"4860680/1120744109/d7159c4a82a9b591134c60a0cb83b2261cb910d1/1783948962/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"4860680/1120744109/d7159c4a82a9b591134c60a0cb83b2261cb910d1/1783948962/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257375961/e53df2f3c218cd94bbe38f438a38172af71dc6aa/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257375961/e53df2f3c